# Build and runtime artifacts
build/
.gotmp/
.devtmp/
runtime/
*.exe
*.test.exe
*.log

# Shell-accident leftovers
=ro
CUsers*
tmp-smoke*.py

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Frontend dependencies and generated reports
web/node_modules/
web/visual-report/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# signing keys
*.key

# Internal engineering records (local paths, account fingerprints, acceptance runs)
_acl-recovery/
docs/_lane-*
docs/_note-*
docs/_p0-*
docs/_ref/
docs/_report-*
docs/_scout-*
docs/acceptance-*
docs/audit-*
docs/evidence*
docs/handoff-*
docs/review-*
docs/verify-*
docs/决策台账-*
docs/对比-*
docs/审计报告-*
docs/评估报告-*

# Internal planning notes
plans/

# One-off local rollback script (hard-coded local runtime paths)
scripts/rollback-eac-plugin.ps1

# Changelogs are development history, not part of the public docs set
docs/变更日志-*.md

# 本轮契约文档例外：11-05 起的执行契约必须进版本控制
!plans/
!plans/2026-11-05-*.md
!docs/handoff-*.md


# P1/P8: magpie-bridge 单文件产物（scripts/build-bridge.ps1 重新生成）——不入库；
# 哈希记录文件例外，入库以便任何机器复核二进制。
/dist/*
!/dist/magpie-bridge.sha256
!/dist/magpie-bridge-linux.sha256
